নিচে $0.\dot{3}$, $0.\dot{2}\dot{4}$, এবং $42.34\dot{7}\dot{8}$ কে সাধারণ ভগ্নাংশে পরিণত করা হয়েছে।
\vspace{-1em}
\begin{small}
\begin{centerpage}{0.9\textwidth}
\begin{align*} 
\text{প্রথমে  \qquad}0.\dot{3} &= 0.3333 \ldots \\
0.\dot{3} \times 10 = 0.333 \ldots \times 10 &= 3.333 \ldots\\
0.\dot{3} \times 1 = 0.333 \ldots \times 1 &= 0.333 \ldots\\[-1em]\cline{1-2}
\text{বিয়োগ করে, }0.\dot{3} \times 10 - 0.\dot{3} \times 1 &=3\\
0.\dot{3} \times (10-1) &= 3\\  
0.\dot{3} \times 9&=3\\
\therefore 0.\dot{3}&=\dfrac{3}{9}=\dfrac{1}{3}
\end{align*}
\end{centerpage}
\begin{centerpage}{0.9\textwidth}
\begin{align*}
\text{এবার \qquad}0.\dot{2}\dot{4}&=\phantom{0}0.24242424 \ldots\\
0.\dot{2}\dot{4} \times 100 = 0.242424 \ldots \times 100 &= 24.24242424 \ldots\\
0.\dot{2}\dot{4} \times 1= 0.242424 \ldots \times 1 &= \phantom{0}0.24242424 \ldots\\[-1em]\cline{1-2}
\text{বিয়োগ করে, }0.\dot{2}\dot{4} \times 99 &=24\\
\therefore 0.\dot{2}\dot{4}&=\dfrac{24}{99} =\dfrac{8}{33}
\end{align*}
\end{centerpage}
\begin{centerpage}{0.9\textwidth}
‌\begin{align*}
\text{শেষে  \qquad}42.34\dot{7}\dot{8}&=\phantom{0000}42.34787878 \ldots\\
42.34\dot{7}\dot{8} \times 10000=42.34787878 \ldots \times 10000 &= 423478.78787878 \ldots\\
42.34\dot{7}\dot{8} \times 100 =4234.7878  \ldots \times 100 &=\phantom{0000}42.34787878  \ldots\\[-1em]\cline{1-2}
\text{বিয়োগ করে, }42.34\dot{7}\dot{8} \times 9900 = 423478-4234 &= 419244\\
\therefore 42.34\dot{7}\dot{8}&=\dfrac{419244}{9900} =\dfrac{34937}{825} = 42\dfrac{287}{825}
\end{align*}
\end{centerpage}
\end{small}
$\therefore$ নির্ণেয় সাধারণ ভগ্নাংশগুলো যথাক্রমে $0.\dot{3} = \dfrac{1}{3},\  0.\dot{2}\dot{4} = \dfrac{8}{33},\  42.34\dot{7}\dot{8} = 42 \dfrac{287}{825}$

